[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0841","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0841.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59871","title":"node-tar PAX数字路径类型混淆拒绝服务漏洞","description":"node-tar 是 Node.js 生态中用于 tar 归档文件操作的库。其 PAX 头部解析器在 pax.ts 的 parseKV 函数中，将全数字的 path 或 linkpath 字段值通过 +v 强制转换为 JavaScript 数值类型。当后续代码对 entry.path 调用 .split('/') 方法时，由于数值类型不存在该方法，抛出未捕获的 TypeError，导致 Node.js 进程崩溃。攻击者只需构造一个约 2.5KB 的恶意 tar 归档文件（包含全数字路径的 PAX 扩展头部），任何调用 node-tar 解压该文件的进程（如 npm 包安装、CI/CD 流水线、文件上传处理等）均会崩溃。该漏洞无法通过 strict: false 或 error 事件处理器捕获，属于拒绝服务漏洞，影响 node-tar 7.5.18 之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59871","GHSA-w8wr-v893-vjvp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:02:55Z","remediation":"将 node-tar（npm 包 tar）升级至 7.5.18 或更高版本：执行 `npm install tar@^7.5.18`。如无法升级，在提取不可信 tar 文件前对 PAX 头部的纯数字 path/linkpath 字段做类型校验（如 `String(entry.path)`），或使用其他 tar 解析库（如 `node-archive`）替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/commit/e02a4e9e013c4be95302e2eb2047a942b883c27b","https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/releases/tag/v7.5.18","https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/security/advisories/GHSA-w8wr-v893-vjvp","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59871.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59871.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b8f3faf694c27edd208769ff59c4ed562dd91eaa/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59871.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59871.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59871.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59871.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59871.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59871.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59871.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/tar/CVE-2026-59871.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0841.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0840","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0840.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59870","title":"nodeca js-yaml 二次复杂度拒绝服务漏洞","description":"js-yaml 5.x 系列引入了 YAML11_SCHEMA 支持，新增了 `!!omap` 有序映射标签。`src/tag/sequence/omap.ts` 文件中的 `omapTag.addItem()` 函数在每次插入时执行线性 O(n) 扫描来检测重复键，导致文档解析时间复杂度达到 O(n²)。攻击者可构造包含大量有序映射项的恶意 YAML 文档，触发目标应用中 `yaml.load()` 的 CPU 占耗，导致系统严重性能下降甚至事件循环长时间卡死。该漏洞影响所有使用 `yaml.load(input, { schema: yaml.YAML11_SCHEMA })` 解析未信任 YAML 输入的应用，尤其在多任务并行处理时更为明显。研究人员实测在 v5.2.0 版本中，输入 50,000 条记录的恶意文档会导致 Node.js 进程卡死超过 10 秒，严重威胁服务器稳定性和可用性。该漏洞最早出现在 2026-06-20 发布的 5.x 系列中，4.x 系列则未受影响。官方安全补丁已发布于 5.2.1 版本，通过使用哈希集合实现 O(1) 时间复杂度的重复键检测，有效解决了这一二次复杂度拒绝服务问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59870","GHSA-724g-mxrg-4qvm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:20:49Z","remediation":"立即升级 js-yaml 到 5.2.1 或更高版本（npm install js-yaml@5.2.1）。若暂时无法升级，请避免使用 yaml.YAML11_SCHEMA 解析不可信 YAML 输入，改用 yaml.JSON_SCHEMA 或 yaml.FAILSAFE_SCHEMA 作为临时缓解措施。修复版本在 omapTag.addItem 中将 O(n) 线性扫描改为 O(1) Set 查找，彻底消除二次复杂度 DoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/commit/39f3211a2f01b3c6982710cf21434ab7060acefe","https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/releases/tag/5.2.1","https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/security/advisories/GHSA-724g-mxrg-4qvm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59870.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b8f3faf694c27edd208769ff59c4ed562dd91eaa/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59870.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59870.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59870.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59870.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59870.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59870.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59870.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/js-yaml/CVE-2026-59870.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59870.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0840.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0839","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0839.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59869","title":"js-yaml YAML 合并键链处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"js-yaml 是一个 JavaScript YAML 解析与序列化库，其 3.0.0 至 3.15.0 版本及 4.0.0 至 4.3.0 版本中存在算法复杂度漏洞。当解析包含合并键（merge key）链的 YAML 文档时，每个新映射都需要枚举前一个映射继承的所有键，导致 N 个链式映射产生 O(N²) 次合并键访问，CPU 消耗随文档大小呈二次方增长。远程攻击者可构造特制 YAML 文件（约 4000 个链式映射即可使解析耗时超过 1 秒），触发拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 3.15.0 和 4.3.0 版本中通过限制单次解析的合并键总数（默认 10000 个）修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59869","GHSA-52cp-r559-cp3m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-13T15:05:34Z","remediation":"升级 js-yaml 至 3.15.0 或 4.3.0 及以上版本。npm 用户执行 `npm install js-yaml@latest`，yarn 用户执行 `yarn add js-yaml@latest`。如无法立即升级，可在解析 YAML 前限制文档大小或禁用 merge key 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/commit/24f13e79ee1343a7e30bd6f6c9d9cdbf0ac9b2b7","https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/commit/59423c6f8cdc78742ac00e25a4dd39ef16b702e4","https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/releases/tag/3.15.0","https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/releases/tag/4.3.0","https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/security/advisories/GHSA-52cp-r559-cp3m","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59869.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59869.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b8f3faf694c27edd208769ff59c4ed562dd91eaa/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59869.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59869.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59869.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59869.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59869.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59869.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59869.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59869.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0839.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0838","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0838.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59868","title":"js-yaml js-yaml YAML合并键链处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"js-yaml 是一个 JavaScript YAML 解析与序列化库。在 5.0.0 至 5.2.0 版本中，当启用合并键（merge keys，`<<`）功能时，攻击者可通过构造包含链式映射的 YAML 文档，使解析器在处理每个新映射时枚举前一个映射继承的所有键，导致 CPU 消耗呈二次方增长（O(N²)）。仅需 N=4000 的链式映射即可造成超过 1 秒的解析延迟，文档大小不足 100KB。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过提交特制 YAML 文件触发此漏洞，造成服务端拒绝服务。该漏洞已在 5.2.0 版本中修复，默认限制每次解析的合并键总数不超过 10000 个。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59868","GHSA-g796-fgmg-93mv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-13T15:06:34Z","remediation":"将 js-yaml 升级至 5.2.0 或更高版本（`npm install js-yaml@5.2.0`）。如无法升级，确保 merge 功能保持默认关闭状态（v5 中 merge 默认关闭），不要显式启用 `YAML11_SCHEMA` 或 `JSON_SCHEMA` 等包含 merge 支持的 schema，并限制解析不可信 YAML 输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/commit/3105455b81dee69e0fd36e09ac0b2ccfdb54adc1","https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/releases/tag/5.2.0","https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml/security/advisories/GHSA-g796-fgmg-93mv","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59868.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59868.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b8f3faf694c27edd208769ff59c4ed562dd91eaa/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59868.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59868.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59868.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59868.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59868.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59868.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59868.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59868.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0838.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0838.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0838.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0829","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0829.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59725","title":"Socket.IO Engine.IO 轮询传输连接耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Socket.IO 的 Engine.IO 组件在处理轮询传输时存在资源未正确释放漏洞（CWE-404）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 Engine.IO 协议 v4 的轮询端点发送 Content-Type 为 application/octet-stream 的无效二进制 POST 请求触发该漏洞。服务端在检测到传输错误后未能正确关闭对应的 HTTP 响应连接，导致每个精心构造的请求都会消耗一个服务端 socket/文件描述符。攻击者可重复发起大量此类请求，耗尽服务器可用 HTTP 连接、socket 或文件描述符等资源，造成拒绝服务，阻止合法客户端正常连接。该漏洞影响 engine.io 4.1.0 至 6.6.7 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 engine.io 6.6.7 版本中修复，修复方式为明确拒绝无效的二进制轮询 POST 请求并正确关闭响应连接。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59725","GHSA-r635-g3xr-vw7x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-13T15:07:44Z","remediation":"升级 engine.io 至 6.6.7 或更高版本：`npm install engine.io@^6.6.7`。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理/WAF 层拦截 Engine.IO v4 轮询 POST 请求中 `Content-Type: application/octet-stream` 的请求，或配置仅使用 WebSocket 传输：`transports: [\"websocket\"]`，并实施 IP 速率限制和连接数限制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/socketio/socket.io/commit/fc11285e14964c2132d122164bf130c355f60671","https://github.com/socketio/socket.io/releases/tag/engine.io@6.6.7","https://github.com/socketio/socket.io/security/advisories/GHSA-r635-g3xr-vw7x","https://github.com/socketio/socket.io/blob/ae7fb46e08c5ed964b4a1ea8b1703e816511598e/SECURITY.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59725.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59725.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59725.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59725.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59725.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59725.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-597xx/CVE-2026-59725.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59725.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/engine.io/CVE-2026-59725.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0829.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0632","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0632.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55668","title":"File Browser 悬空符号链接跟随导致越界文件创建漏洞","description":"File Browser 的 ScopedFs 组件在文件写入操作中存在符号链接验证绕过漏洞。ScopedFs 用于将每个用户限制在其作用域目录内，其 within() 守卫函数本应拒绝任何通过符号链接逃逸出作用域的操作。然而，当符号链接的目标文件不存在时（即悬空符号链接），守卫函数会向上回溯到最近的已存在父目录进行验证，由于该父目录在作用域内，守卫返回\"在作用域内\"通过检查。随后 os.OpenFile(O_CREATE) 会跟随该悬空符号链接，在作用域外的目标路径创建文件。攻击条件为：攻击者需已通过身份认证，拥有 Create 和 Modify 权限，且用户作用域内存在指向外部路径的悬空符号链接。成功利用后，经过身份验证的低权限用户可在其作用域外创建任意内容的文件，在多用户部署场景下可跨租户写入其他用户目录（如脚本、HTML 页面、SSH 授权密钥等），在 File Browser 以 root 权限运行的部署中可导致远程代码执行。该漏洞是 GHSA-239w-m3h6-ch8v 的补丁绕过变种，影响 File Browser 2.63.15 及之前版本，已在 2.63.16 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55668","GHSA-8wc8-hf36-mjh9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T15:16:30Z","updated":"2026-07-08T17:17:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 File Browser 至 v2.63.16 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ScopedFs 对悬空符号链接的路径验证缺陷。若无法立即升级，应限制用户的 Create 和 Modify 权限，并定期使用 `find /path/to/scope -type l` 命令扫描用户 scope 目录中的悬空符号链接，及时清理指向外部路径的链接。对于多用户部署，建议将各用户 scope 目录隔离在不同父目录下，避免共享目录结构。详细修复信息请参考 GitHub 安全公告 GHSA-8wc8-hf36-mjh9。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/commit/64511ce45e3be379e965f7f4fb0929a068d5bb81","https://github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/releases/tag/v2.63.16","https://github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/security/advisories/GHSA-8wc8-hf36-mjh9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55668.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55668.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55668.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55668.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55668.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2026/CVE-2026-55668.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55668.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-556xx/CVE-2026-55668.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-55668.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/0c336e1b86972b4210fc8388a318964ce8d85a8e/content/posts/cve-2026-55668.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0632.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0612","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0612.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55438","title":"Coder Coder workspace app CORS 校验绕过漏洞","description":"Coder 远程开发环境平台的工作区应用子域名代理存在 CORS 源校验绕过漏洞。当工作区名称的子域名段被解析为 UUID 时，系统仅通过 ID 解析工作区而未验证 URL 中的用户名是否与真实所有者匹配，同时 CORS 中间件信任了未经核验的主机名用户名。已认证的攻击者可构造包含自身工作区 UUID 和受害者用户名的恶意子域名 URL，诱使已登录的受害者访问后，攻击者的 JavaScript 可发起携带凭据的跨域 fetch() 请求读取受害者工作区应用中的敏感数据，导致信息泄露。该漏洞需要启用通配符子域名应用路由且受害者主动访问恶意链接方可利用，影响 Coder 2.34.2 之前的多条发布线。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55438","GHSA-5wg6-jmq2-53pw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T01:16:28Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:38:38Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder 至修复版本：v2.34.2、v2.33.8、v2.32.7 或 v2.29.17（ESR），具体根据当前使用的发布线选择对应版本。升级后重启 Coder 服务使补丁生效。该漏洞无临时缓解措施，必须通过版本升级修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26085","https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26086","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-5wg6-jmq2-53pw","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/87c3c6939cf4753db954551441a9567082e88cc1/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55438.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55438.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55438.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c21137571cced5c6655bc31f22872abfb39df64b/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55438.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/ef3dc9430f65ce0192f2cbd3157225a5da8707d7/content/posts/cve-2026-55438.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-5918.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55438.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55438.md","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/2de2525ff4f22f16243444d8222f304029402f46/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/Huangu0/sec_rss_news/blob/c46faafa70787fe2612f0051de58d5a05bef4d0b/output/daily/2026-07-08.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0612.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0612.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0611","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0611.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55437","title":"Coder Coder 代理日志 AgentLogLine 组件存储型 HTML 注入漏洞","description":"Coder 工作区代理日志组件 AgentLogLine 存在存储型 HTML 注入漏洞。该组件在实例化 ansi-to-html 库时未启用 escapeXML 参数，且通过 dangerouslySetInnerHTML 将日志内容直接插入 DOM，导致嵌入工作区代理日志中的 HTML 标签被浏览器解析为活跃标记。服务端过滤机制未能对 HTML 元字符进行转义处理。攻击者只需拥有工作区运行权限，即可在代理日志中注入恶意 HTML 内容；当其他用户（包括管理员）在仪表盘查看该工作区日志时，注入的 HTML 将在其浏览器会话中执行。虽然内容安全策略（CSP）可阻止内联脚本执行，但攻击者仍可通过 meta refresh 重定向、CSS 样式篡改界面、外部图片探针等方式实施数据窃取或钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响 Coder v2.34.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。官方已在 v2.29.17、v2.32.7、v2.33.8 和 v2.34.2 版本中通过启用 escapeXML 参数修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55437","GHSA-7qw2-f75v-62f7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T01:16:28Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:38:48Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder 至以下对应版本：v2.34.2（2.34 线）、v2.33.8（2.33 线）、v2.32.7（2.32 线）或 v2.29.17（ESR 线）。该漏洞无临时缓解措施，必须通过升级修复。升级后确认 `ansi-to-html` 的 `escapeXML` 参数已设为 `true`，防止代理日志中 HTML 元字符被渲染为活代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/25808","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-7qw2-f75v-62f7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55437.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-55437.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c21137571cced5c6655bc31f22872abfb39df64b/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55437.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55437.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/ef3dc9430f65ce0192f2cbd3157225a5da8707d7/content/posts/cve-2026-55437.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55437.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-5919.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-7qw2-f75v-62f7/GHSA-7qw2-f75v-62f7.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55437.json","https://github.com/midnightconman/go_vulndb/blob/d993e2e5e84dd30ceb1958dc17e25f002fffd6f7/ID/GO-2026-5919.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0611.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0611.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0611.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0610","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0610.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55436","title":"Coder AI Bridge Proxy 默认配置跳过 TLS 证书校验漏洞","description":"Coder AI Bridge Proxy（aibridgeproxyd）默认配置下使用 InsecureSkipVerify: true 的 Go 代理传输层，导致出站 HTTPS 连接接受任意 TLS 证书，不验证服务器身份。中间人攻击者通过 ARP 欺骗、DNS 投毒或代理环境变量劫持，可拦截 Coder 会话令牌、用户提供的 API 密钥以及包含提示词和响应的完整请求体。该漏洞影响 Coder v2.30.0 至 v2.34.1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.4，危害等级高。官方已在 v2.32.7、v2.33.8 和 v2.34.2 中无条件启用 TLS 1.2+ 及系统根 CA 校验修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55436","GHSA-84rm-42xw-mx52"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T01:16:27Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:39:30Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder AI Bridge Proxy 至 v2.34.2（推荐）、v2.33.8 或 v2.32.7 及以上版本，修复将无条件启用 TLS 1.2+ 证书校验。如无法升级，确保 Coder access URL 使用受信证书，并将 AI Bridge Proxy 与 Coder 服务器部署在同一回环地址或配置 mTLS 以加固网络路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26131","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-84rm-42xw-mx52","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55436.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-08/TIER_3_CVE-2026-55436.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55436.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a2c62c60ff1862a166bb0b583b0e40e8effbf660/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55436.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/ef3dc9430f65ce0192f2cbd3157225a5da8707d7/content/posts/cve-2026-55436.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55436.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-5920.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/a753fa7a7dd11ae0de2e898bbb409fb0d2a2b3f6/posts/cve-2026-55436-go-github-com-coder-coder-v2.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-84rm-42xw-mx52/GHSA-84rm-42xw-mx52.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55436.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0610.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0607","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0607.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55433","title":"Coder Devcontainer 重建接口授权绕过漏洞","description":"Coder 远程开发环境平台中的 Devcontainer 重建接口存在授权绕过漏洞（CWE-862）。该接口仅依赖路由中间件检查 ActionRead 权限，未像删除接口那样执行 ActionUpdate 权限校验，导致拥有只读工作空间访问权限的低权限角色（如 Template Admin）可触发破坏性重建操作，造成容器内未提交数据丢失，反复调用可导致拒绝服务。攻击者需预先获得目标工作空间的低权限访问凭证方可利用。Coder 已在 v2.29.17、v2.32.7、v2.33.8、v2.34.2 版本中通过添加显式 ActionUpdate 授权检查修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55433","GHSA-jqj2-x4c5-jfxm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T01:16:27Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:39:45Z","remediation":"tags.<value>立即将 Coder 升级至对应版本的补丁版本：2.34.x 用户升级到 v2.34.2，2.33.x 用户升级到 v2.33.8，2.32.x 用户升级到 v2.32.7，2.29.x ESR 用户升级到 v2.29.17。升级后验证 devcontainer recreate 接口的权限检查已生效，确保低权限角色（如 Template Admin）无法再调用该接口销毁容器。如暂时无法升级，可通过限制低权限角色对 target workspace 的访问来降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/25812","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-jqj2-x4c5-jfxm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b6911473cb9f3b7c6e3bfc931e2219f763048798/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55433.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-55433.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a2c62c60ff1862a166bb0b583b0e40e8effbf660/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55433.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55433.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/ef3dc9430f65ce0192f2cbd3157225a5da8707d7/content/posts/cve-2026-55433.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55433.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-5922.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-jqj2-x4c5-jfxm/GHSA-jqj2-x4c5-jfxm.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9d5b2a1dce9c7e458934cecfd52fe64aaa62e247/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55433.json","https://github.com/midnightconman/go_vulndb/blob/d993e2e5e84dd30ceb1958dc17e25f002fffd6f7/ID/GO-2026-5922.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0607.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0607.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0606","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55432","title":"Coder 远程开发环境 子代理应用注册绕过端口共享策略授权漏洞","description":"Coder 远程开发环境平台存在权限绕过漏洞，其 `CreateSubAgent` RPC 接口在持久化工作区应用时未验证请求的应用共享级别是否符合模板配置的 `MaxPortSharingLevel` 上限，导致工作区所有者能够绕过管理员设置的端口共享策略。攻击者若拥有其控制工作区的 agent token，可将子代理应用注册为 `PUBLIC` 级别，即使模板策略限制为 `owner` 级别，从而将应用暴露给未认证用户，造成信息泄露风险。该漏洞仅影响启用 Enterprise 端口共享策略并使用通配符应用主机名的部署环境。Coder 公司已在 v2.29.17、v2.32.7、v2.33.8 和 v2.34.2 版本中修复此问题，用户亦可临时禁用通配符应用主机名 (`CODER_WILDCARD_ACCESS_URL`) 作为缓解措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55432","GHSA-x9qq-2qh5-8rxf"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T01:16:27Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:40:36Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Coder 升级到以下已修复版本：2.29 系列升级至 v2.29.17，2.32 系列升级至 v2.32.7，2.33 系列升级至 v2.33.8，或 2.34 系列升级至 v2.34.2。升级可通过访问 Coder 设置页面或使用安装程序完成。如无法立即升级，作为临时缓解措施，请禁用通配符应用主机名（将环境变量 CODER_WILDCARD_ACCESS_URL 设置为空或不配置），以阻止基于子域的应用路由，防止未经授权的用户通过通配符域名访问工作区应用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26061","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-x9qq-2qh5-8rxf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1930d8e9c9119e24dda550971a0deb081f5af159/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55432.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-55432.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e3454357078cf368426374d4a62627b3db36a838/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55432.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55432.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/ef3dc9430f65ce0192f2cbd3157225a5da8707d7/content/posts/cve-2026-55432.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55432.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/365ac029e77c4cbd9f137b462789ede1e72fd329/data/reports/GO-2026-5926.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-x9qq-2qh5-8rxf/GHSA-x9qq-2qh5-8rxf.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0f7d9238ba77f900663100d40113352eb3a480d7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55432.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0605","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0605.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55431","title":"Coder 远程开发环境 会话令牌泄露漏洞","description":"Coder 的 `coder open app` 命令在打开外部工作区应用 URL 时未对 URL 协议和主机进行验证。当外部应用 URL 中包含 `$SESSION_TOKEN` 占位符时，CLI 会将其替换为用户的真实会话令牌，然后将该 URL 交给操作系统打开处理。攻击者可通过控制恶意工作区模板，定义包含 `$SESSION_TOKEN` 的外部应用 URL，当受害者运行 `coder open app` 时，会将会话令牌发送给攻击者，导致账户被完全冒充。攻击者还可利用此路径调用任意本地 URI 协议处理程序。该漏洞影响 Coder 2.29.7 之前、2.32.7 之前、2.33.8 之前和 2.34.2 之前的版本，CVSS 评分为 7.7（高危）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55431","GHSA-v54h-cp2w-9x4g"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T01:16:27Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:42:45Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder 至以下版本之一：v2.34.2（推荐）、v2.33.8、v2.32.7 或 ESR 分支 v2.29.17，这些版本修复了外部应用 URL 的会话令牌泄露问题。若暂时无法升级，应禁止在不受信任的工作区中运行 `coder open app` 命令，并在组织层面限制模板作者对外部应用 URL 的配置权限，以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26146","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-v54h-cp2w-9x4g","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55431.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-08/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55431.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55431.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e3454357078cf368426374d4a62627b3db36a838/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55431.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/c3dfdc2468cdb0a89c10a40e310466fb77d5febc/content/posts/cve-2026-55431.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55431.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/bf521aa55027ec70116c83b3d6469f19d142a95d/cve/CVE-2026-55431.html","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/365ac029e77c4cbd9f137b462789ede1e72fd329/data/osv/GO-2026-5924.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-v54h-cp2w-9x4g/GHSA-v54h-cp2w-9x4g.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0f7d9238ba77f900663100d40113352eb3a480d7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55431.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0605.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0604","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0604.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55430","title":"Coder Coder 工作区应用子域名路由信任未认证 X-Forwarded-Host 头漏洞","description":"Coder 工作区应用代理在解析目标应用时优先信任 `X-Forwarded-Host` 请求头而非真实的 `Host` 请求头，且未对该头进行任何中间件过滤或校验，同时该头在浏览器端 JavaScript 发起的 `fetch()` 请求中可被任意设置。攻击者通过控制共享工作区应用，在页面中植入恶意 JavaScript，向受害者私有应用的子域名发送带有伪造 `X-Forwarded-Host` 头的同站请求，由于应用会话 Cookie 作用域为通配符父域名，浏览器会自动附加受害者 Cookie，导致服务器按攻击者控制的请求头路由但使用受害者 Cookie 鉴权，从而跨应用读取受害者私有应用的响应数据。利用前提包括启用子域名应用路由（通配符主机名）、受害者访问攻击者共享应用、且上游反向代理未剥离 `X-Forwarded-Host` 头。该漏洞影响 Coder 多个版本，已在 v2.29.17、v2.32.7、v2.33.8 和 v2.34.2 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55430","GHSA-5g4w-3vw9-478w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T01:16:27Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:43:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder 至以下修复版本：v2.34.2、v2.33.8、v2.32.7 或 v2.29.17（ESR）。如无法立即升级，在上游反向代理（如 Nginx、HAProxy）中配置剥离或覆盖不可信请求的 X-Forwarded-Host 头，并确保子域名应用路由（通配符主机名）仅对受信任网络启用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26204","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-5g4w-3vw9-478w","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55430.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55430.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e3454357078cf368426374d4a62627b3db36a838/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55430.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/c3dfdc2468cdb0a89c10a40e310466fb77d5febc/content/posts/cve-2026-55430.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55430.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/365ac029e77c4cbd9f137b462789ede1e72fd329/data/reports/GO-2026-5917.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-5g4w-3vw9-478w/GHSA-5g4w-3vw9-478w.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0f7d9238ba77f900663100d40113352eb3a480d7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55430.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/midnightconman/go_vulndb/blob/d993e2e5e84dd30ceb1958dc17e25f002fffd6f7/ID/GO-2026-5917.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0604.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0604.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0603","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0603.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55429","title":"Coder Coder 跨工作空间工作区应用重绑定漏洞","description":"Coder 远程开发环境管理平台中存在授权绕过漏洞（CWE-639），源于 `UpsertWorkspaceApp` 函数在处理主键冲突时直接覆盖已有工作空间应用的 `agent_id`，且 `insertAgentApp` 函数未验证 `CompleteJob` 载荷中的应用 ID 是否属于当前构建的工作空间。具有模板作者或外部编排器操作权限的攻击者可通过构造恶意 `CompleteJob` 请求，将已知受害者应用 UUID 绑定到攻击者控制的代理上，导致受害者的 IDE 会话、终端连接等应用流量被代理至攻击者的工作空间，造成敏感信息泄露和会话劫持。该漏洞影响 Coder 2.34.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55429","GHSA-9rjw-3gwp-f59v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T00:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:43:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder 至对应修复版本：v2.34.x 升级至 v2.34.2，v2.33.x 升级至 v2.33.8，v2.32.x 升级至 v2.32.7，v2.29.x (ESR) 升级至 v2.29.17。该漏洞无临时缓解措施，必须通过升级修复。升级后 `UpsertWorkspaceApp` 会校验 app ID 是否属于当前构建的工作空间，拒绝跨工作空间 agent 重绑定。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26103","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-9rjw-3gwp-f59v","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55429.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-55429.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-08/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55429.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55429.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55429.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/c3dfdc2468cdb0a89c10a40e310466fb77d5febc/content/posts/cve-2026-55429.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55429.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/365ac029e77c4cbd9f137b462789ede1e72fd329/data/osv/GO-2026-5909.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/d7c55c9a974157157d93538e2eb16bd0def0cb3a/posts/cve-2026-55429-go-github-com-coder-coder-v2.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-9rjw-3gwp-f59v/GHSA-9rjw-3gwp-f59v.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0603.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0602","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0602.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55428","title":"Coder 尾网协调器 AllowedIPs 校验缺失导致路由劫持漏洞","description":"Coder 尾网协调器（tailnet coordinator）在验证代理节点时，仅校验其 `Addresses` 字段是否源自认证 UUID，但未对 `AllowedIPs` 字段进行同等检查。恶意工作区代理可向协调器提交伪造的 `AllowedIPs` 前缀（如其他代理的尾网地址），协调器将其原样转发给隧道对端并写入 WireGuard 对端配置，导致路由劫持。攻击者利用此漏洞可拦截 Web 终端和工作区应用的流量，提供伪造内容。利用条件为拥有运行中工作区的认证用户配合修改过的代理二进制文件。该漏洞影响 Coder 2.34.2 之前版本、2.33.8 之前版本、2.32.7 之前版本及 2.29.17 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高危。官方已在对应版本中修复，修复方式为对 `AllowedIPs` 前缀进行与 `Addresses` 相同的 UUID 校验。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55428","GHSA-wrq8-fcv5-8hvp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T00:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:44:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder 至以下已修复版本：v2.34.2、v2.33.8、v2.32.7 或 v2.29.17（ESR）。如无法立即升级，应持续监控 tailnet coordinator 日志中是否存在 agent 广播异常 AllowedIPs 前缀的行为，并配合入侵检测系统对可疑路由变更进行告警。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26144","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-wrq8-fcv5-8hvp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55428.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-55428.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55428.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-07/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55428.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55428.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/c3dfdc2468cdb0a89c10a40e310466fb77d5febc/content/posts/cve-2026-55428.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/d7c55c9a974157157d93538e2eb16bd0def0cb3a/cve/CVE-2026-55428.html","https://github.com/psocik/ict/blob/4daa03e1e71b4967af2efc3f6fa35004d37aa3a7/_posts/2026/2026-07-08-CVE-2026-55428-Coder-Vulnerability-Route-Hijacking-Risk.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/365ac029e77c4cbd9f137b462789ede1e72fd329/data/osv/GO-2026-5915.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-wrq8-fcv5-8hvp/GHSA-wrq8-fcv5-8hvp.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0602.toml"}]